---
import { getLatestPatch } from '../../lib/data';
import HomeReturn from './HomeReturn';
import '../../styles/companion-home.css';
const latest = getLatestPatch();
---
<div class="companion-home">
  <section class="companion-intro" aria-labelledby="companion-heading">
    <div class="companion-landscape" aria-hidden="true">
      <picture><source media="(max-width: 700px)" srcset="/images/voyage/rift-overlook-mobile.webp" /><img src="/images/voyage/rift-overlook.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></picture>
    </div>
    <div class="companion-intro-grid">
      <div class="companion-intro-copy">
        <p class="companion-eyebrow">YOUR LEAGUE OF LEGENDS COMPANION</p>
        <h1 id="companion-heading"><span>Your next game.</span> <em>Already prepared.</em></h1>
        <p class="companion-description">Enter your Riot ID. Get a session recap, changes for your champions, and a useful focus from your recent games.</p>
        <div class="companion-main-actions">
          <a class="companion-action" href="/next-game">Get my briefing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="companion-action companion-action--quiet" href="/players">Find my games <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <a class="companion-text-link companion-patch-link" href="/pool#briefing">See my champion changes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <HomeReturn client:load />
        <p class="companion-welcome">Ranked, ARAM, or a game with friends.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="companion-briefing" aria-labelledby="home-briefing-heading">
        <div class="companion-briefing-title"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m24 3 18 21-18 21L6 24 24 3Z" stroke="currentColor" /><path d="m24 12 10 12-10 12-10-12 10-12Z" stroke="currentColor" /><path d="M24 3v9m0 24v9M6 24h8m20 0h8" stroke="currentColor" /></svg><h2 id="home-briefing-heading">Your automatic briefing</h2><span class="companion-feature-mark">FROM THE GAMES YOU PLAY</span></div>
        <p class="companion-briefing-promise">What matters<br />before you queue.</p>
        <p class="companion-briefing-description">RiftScry reads your available match history and brings the useful parts together, ready when you open it.</p>
        <ol class="companion-briefing-steps">
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><strong>Your latest session, reviewed</strong><p>Results and patterns from the games already recorded.</p></div></li>
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><strong>Changes since you played</strong><p>Patch records for champions found in your recent games.</p></div></li>
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><strong>One useful next focus</strong><p>A practical starting point, with the evidence behind it.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
        <a class="companion-text-link" href="/next-game">See my briefing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <p class="companion-local-note">Generated from available matches. Your player stays selected in this browser.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="companion-everyday" aria-labelledby="everyday-heading">
    <header><p class="companion-eyebrow">THE REVIEW IS ALREADY DONE</p><h2 id="everyday-heading">You play.<br />RiftScry catches up.</h2><p>Open your briefing for the useful details. Follow the evidence when you want to understand more.</p></header>
    <div class="companion-task-list">
      <a href="/next-game"><span class="companion-task-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h3>See what your games reveal</h3><p>Your recent session and a useful next focus are assembled from the available match sample.</p></div><span class="companion-task-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="/next-game#changes"><span class="companion-task-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h3>Catch changes you missed</h3><p>See archived changes since the last recorded game on each of your recent champions. Your matches choose the starting point.</p></div><span class="companion-task-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="/players?view=builds"><span class="companion-task-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><h3>Find the build you played</h3><p>Recorded loadouts are grouped from your matches, with their champion, mode and source game ready to inspect.</p></div><span class="companion-task-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="companion-explore" aria-labelledby="home-explore-heading">
    <div><p class="companion-eyebrow">CHAMPIONS &amp; PATCHES</p><h2 id="home-explore-heading">Every change has a history.</h2><p>Take the scenic route through champions, patches and the records that connect them.</p></div>
    <div class="companion-explore-actions"><a class="companion-action companion-action--quiet" href="/explore">Explore the Rift <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="companion-text-link" href={`/patch/${latest.id}`}>Latest archived patch · {latest.id} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </section>
</div>
